The '''Gardeneel Bros.''' (チンアナ5兄弟 ''Chin'ana 5 Kyōdai'', '''5 Garden Eel Brothers''') are a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] enemy found in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]].

